reative Brand Identity Logo, guidelines & assets Infographics Complex data made visual Brand Product content that sells See design work Book a Demo Development Platforms RegiMan Platform Registration & warranty OPL Data Platform 16M-component parts library PDF ReMarket Platform Turn PDFs into live pages Engineering API / ERP Integration ERP, PIM, CRM & marketplace sync Applications / Plugins Apps, widgets & extensions Maintenance & Recovery Updates, fixes & recovery Platform Product data at scale Explore OPL Data Book a Demo Optimization AI / AEO / GEO Optimization AEO, GEO & LLM citations On-Page SEO Optimizations Technical & content SEO Optimized Hosting | Core Web Vitals Speed & stability scores Mobile & Responsive Design Fast on every device Search Console & Analytics Measurement & insights Growth Get discovered and convert Explore AI discovery Book a Demo Marketing Press Release Marketing Write, design & distribute Blog / Article Syndication Content that ranks & syndicates Social Media Marketing Build & engage your audience Email Marketing Campaigns that convert AdWords / ReMarketing PPC & retargeting Growth Demand generation that performs Explore marketing Book a Demo Book a Demo +1 (866) 297-5850 sales@distyman.com Contact Us Book a Demo E-COMMERCE, DESIGN, DEVELOPMENT & MARKETING FOR Electronic and Electrical Component Suppliers We provide end-to-end design, development and digital marketing services for electronic and electrical component manufacturers and distributors. Our proprietary e-commerce platform offers perfect web vitals (google) and catalog management with best-in-class SEO to help suppliers reach more customers and grow business. Custom Design & Development SEO | AEO | GEO Optimization Content Management & Writing Press Release Marketing & Advertising Book a Demo E-Commerce development & support Design for print and digital Content technical writing Marketing press releases & advertising DESIGN, DEVELOPMENT & MARKETING FOR COMPONENT DISTRIBUTORS & MANUFACTURERS One Partner for Your Entire Digital Commerce Strategy Electronic and electrical component websites must make complex product\ncatalogs easy to search, filter, compare and purchase. DistyMan combines\nindustry-specific design, custom development, technical content, product\ndata, SEO and digital marketing to help manufacturers and distributors\ncreate a complete digital commerce operation. Catalogs | Datasheet Libraries Create professional print and digital catalogs that make complex electronic and\nelectrical component products easier to find, understand and purchase. We\nstructure product information, categories and selection guides while combining\ntechnical specifications, product data and user-friendly design for catalogs that\nsupport sales and marketing across every channel. Custom Design & Development Design and develop custom websites and applications built around your products,\ncustomers and business requirements. We combine UX/UI design, custom\ndevelopment and e-commerce expertise to create responsive websites, product\ninterfaces, technical catalogs, customer portals and integrations that are intuitive,\nscalable and designed to support your business. E-Commerce Design, develop, integrate and optimize e-commerce websites using DistyMan’s\nadvanced proprietary platform or leading technologies such as Shopify,\nBigCommerce and WooCommerce. We build the right solution around your\nproducts, customers, processes and growth goals, ensuring your technology\nsupports your business rather than dictating how it operates. Content Management Turn complex product information into clear, accurate and usable content for\ndigital commerce and marketing. We create technical product content including\nspecifications, attributes, datasheets, documentation, product descriptions,\ntechnical writing and illustrations that make products easier to understand,\ndiscover and purchase while supporting search engine visibility. SEO, AEO, GEO & AI Visibility Optimize product categories, manufacturer pages, part numbers and technical\ncontent for traditional search and AI-driven discovery. DistyMan combines onpage\nSEO, structured data, AEO, GEO, technical content, internal linking and\nmachine-readable product information to improve visibility across search engines\nand emerging AI platforms. Digital Marketing Keep generating traffic, leads and sales after launch with digital marketing built\naround your products and target customers. We provide PPC advertising,\nshopping feeds, remarketing, content marketing, email campaigns and other\ndigital marketing services designed to increase visibility, reach qualified buyers\nand support long-term e-commerce growth. DISTYMAN E -COMMERCE PLATFORM Electronic & Electrical Component E-Commerce for Complex Catalogs Engineered to meet the needs of electronic component and electrical\ncomponent designers and buyers, DistyMan’s E-Commerce Platform is\noptimized for large catalogs of technical content with lightning-fast\nperformance, real-time inventory, ERP integration, advanced search, and\nscalable workflows. <500ms page load speed Perfect core web vitals 10x smaller page size ERP/API Ready sync everything *Performance varies by catalog, integrations, media and deployment configuration. Performance DistyMan E-Commerce is Smaller & Faster with Perfect Web Vital Scores We compared DistyMan with ten of the largest e-commerce platforms, measuring monthly cost, Core Web Vitals, page size and page speed. DistyMan is at least 5× better on all levels. Compared to our largest competitor, we found DistyMan offered: - Perfect Core Web Vitals - >20× smaller page size - >5× faster page loads OPL Data Build searchable catalogs from a 16-million-component data library. Explore OPL Data → RegiMan Manage product registration, warranties and post-sale customer relationships. Explore RegiMan → API & ERP integration Synchronize products, pricing, inventory, customers and orders. Explore integrations → Plugins Add AI discovery, remarketing and commerce features without rebuilding the platform. Explore plugins → PDF Re-Market Turn technical PDFs and datasheets into measurable paths back to your catalog. Explore PDF Re-Market → Hosting & support Managed delivery, monitoring, backups, recovery and ongoing maintenance. Explore hosting → E-Commerce platform Retail DistyMan retail e-commerce delivers sub-500ms consumer storefronts with promotions, product discovery and streamlined checkout — all with perfect Core Web Vitals scores. Pair the platform with our design, content and marketing services to launch a store that converts. Explore retail → B2B High-performance B2B e-commerce for distributors with sub-500ms catalogs, AI-powered search, real-time inventory and ERP integration. Support customer-specific pricing, RFQ workflows, purchase orders and credit terms — with no transaction fees. Explore B2B → Unified DistyMan Unified runs retail and B2B commerce on one high-performance catalog — dual pricing tiers, shared inventory and a single product data model. Shoppers get consumer checkout while business buyers get RFQ and PO workflows, all on sub-500ms pages. Explore unified → Marketplace Launch a multi-vendor marketplace with shared catalogs, vendor onboarding tools and complex order-splitting workflows. DistyMan marketplace e-commerce keeps page loads under 500ms while scaling to many suppliers — with no per-transaction fees. Explore marketplace → Hosting & Security Managed LiteSpeed hosting with CDN delivery, GZIP compression, image optimization and firewall protection — backed by automated backups and website recovery. Built for electronic component manufacturers and distributors who need ISO 27001-aligned security practices. Explore hosting → Development tools OPL Data OPL Data populates your storefront from a library of 16 million electronic components — clean specs, datasheets and parametric attributes ready for search. Import/export mapping tools ensure your catalog is complete and search-ready from day one. Explore OPL Data → RegiMan RegiMan is DistyMan's product registration and warranty management module — capture end-user registrations, track serial numbers and manage warranty claims in one place. Turn after-sale data into re-orders, support insight and stronger customer relationships. Explore RegiMan → Plugins Extend DistyMan with plugins that increase ROI — ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Gemini and Grok AI optimization, AdWords remarketing, re-order marketing, Google Store integration and PDF remarketing. Add capabilities without rebuilding your core platform. Explore plugins → PDF Remarket PDF Re-Market embeds ROI into every datasheet download — direct links back to your site in every catalog PDF you distribute. Drive return traffic, build SEO value from technical documents and turn passive downloads into lead-generation assets. Explore PDF Remarket → API & ERP Integration Connect DistyMan with your ERP, CRM, PIM, supplier feeds and marketplace channels through robust API integration. Sync product data, inventory levels, customer pricing and orders in real time — keeping your e-commerce site aligned with back-office systems. Explore integrations → Maintenance & Recovery Website maintenance, recovery, repairs and update services for component industry e-commerce sites. Fix broken functionality, restore from backups, improve security posture and keep your platform current — with 24/5 monitoring from our global team. Explore maintenance → SUPPORT ON-DEMAND OR UNDER-CONTRACT A Team Behind Every Project Utilizing the latest technologies and tools with decades of experience across web, print, content and AI projects. Design & Brand Award-winning design for catalogs, specification libraries, advertisements and more - tuned for electronic and electrical component industries. Catalogs & Guides → Custom Development Development of custom applications and plugins as well as AI specialists supporting the unique needs of the electronic / electrical industry. Apps & Plugins → Advanced Hosting DistyMan approaches website speed as a complete system rather than relying on a single optimization plugin or server setting. Optimized Hosting → Content Management Turn scattered technical documents into a professional, searchable and consistent datasheet library for electronic and electrical components. Datasheet Library → Selected work Commerce built around real catalogs Examples shaped around different products, buyers and workflows. OmniChannel marketplace DistyParts 16 million parts, 1150 categories, 100+ distributors - listing inventory of sellers for online transactions and quotation requests. Unified commerce E-T-A Circuit Breakers Two distinct markets, and varying price levels for channel part partners and their customers. B2B Distributor Electroverge Self-Managed e-commerce supporting direct sales for small number of offshore factories. B2B Distributor Braun EC More than 200,000 parts from franchised lines and excess sources. Insights Practical guidance for component commerce Adobe Commerce Alternative for Distributors | DistyMan vs Magento Compare DistyMan vs Adobe Commerce and Magento for 100,000-part B2B catalogs. Compare cost, PageSpeed, technical product data, parametric search, SEO and distributor e-commerce features. Read article → BigCommerce Alternative for Distributors | DistyMan vs BigCommerce Compare DistyMan vs BigCommerce for 100,000-part B2B catalogs. Compare cost, PageSpeed, parametric search, product data, SEO and distributor e-commerce features. Read article → Distributor E-Commerce Discover 12 essential distributor e-commerce features, from ERP integration and B2B pricing to advanced product search, SEO and website performance. Read article → View all insights Ready when you are Bring your catalog. We’ll show you the platform. Walk through performance, discovery and integration options for your actual product and buyer requirements. Book a Demo Talk to Sales Digital commerce, product data 