*   [Analytics & Dashboards](https://vantage.co/smartvue-2/)\n    *   [Integrations](https://vantage.co/flexconnex-integrations/)\n    *   [Digital Waivers](https://vantage.co/waivervue-digital-waiver/)\n    *   [Guest Verification](https://vantage.co/smartcheck-guest-verification/)\n    *   [](https://vantage.co/#)\n\n*   [About Us](https://vantage.co/about-us/)\n    *   [Meet Our Team](https://vantage.co/meet-our-team/)\n\n*   [Resources](https://vantage.co/#)\n    *   [Webinar](https://vantage.co/webinar/)\n    *   [Blog](https://vantage.co/resources-and-blog)\n    *   [Download Brochure](https://vantage.co/#)\n    *   [The Joy Economy](https://vantage.co/the-joy-economy/)\n\n[](https://vantage.co/#)\n\n[Contact Us](https://vantage.co/contact-us/)\n\nYou Design the Experience,We'll Build It The most memorable venues aren't built from technology; they're built from bold ideas. Vantage gives you the platform to bring those ideas to life, creating guest experiences backed by smarter operations.[Contact Us](https://vantage.co/vantage-book-a-demo/) From the   \n Guest Journey When systems don’t connect, guests feel it. Vantage brings every touchpoint together so guests can move, pay, and access experiences without interruption, creating better reviews and return rates.Remove Friction[Contact Us](https://vantage.co/vantage-book-a-demo/)Make Faster Decisions With Vantage gives you one view across your venue, helping you manage flow, optimize staffing, and make faster decisions based on what's happening in real-time.[Contact Us](https://vantage.co/vantage-book-a-demo/)Connected Data\n\n### Flexible Features\n\n## Build the Technology Mix Your  \n Venue Needs\n\nVantage integrates with your existing attraction technology and third-party systems while giving you the flexibility to choose the features that make sense for your venue. Add more as your needs evolve and build a connected platform that grows alongside your guest experience, revenue and operational ambitions.\n\n[Video 1](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/FlexConnex-Short-1.mp4)\n\n[![Image 4](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Loyalty-and-Gamification-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/myperks-loyalty-and-gamification-program/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Loyalty & Gamification Program](https://vantage.co/myperks-loyalty-and-gamification-program/)\n\n  \n\nTransform casual visitors into loyal fans. MyPerks is a customizable rewards program that keeps guests coming back for more.\n\n[![Image 5](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-1-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/mycart-2/)\n\n  \n\n#### [E-Commerce](https://vantage.co/mycart-2/)\n\n  \n\nGive guests a convenient mobile ordering and e-commerce experience for purchases, upgrades and add-ons throughout their visit.\n\n[![Image 6](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-1-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/smartvue-2/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Analytics & Dashboards](https://vantage.co/smartvue-2/)\n\n  \n\nTurn real-time guest and operational data into actionable venue analytics that help your team make better decisions.\n\n[![Image 7](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/VATNTAGE-SA-ZOO-15-1-600x400.jpg)](https://vantage.co/smartcontrol-access-control/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Access Control](https://vantage.co/smartcontrol-access-control/)\n\n  \n\nSimplify venue access control and guest entitlements while giving operations teams greater visibility across your venue.\n\n[![Image 8](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Push-Notifications-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/smartnotify-personalized-push-notification/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Personalized Push Notifications](https://vantage.co/smartnotify-personalized-push-notification/)\n\n  \n\nDeliver personalized messages and offers directly to guests' phones, enhancing their experience and driving revenue.\n\n[![Image 9](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Vantage-at-San-Antonio-Zoo-SmartPay-1536x864-1.jpg)](https://vantage.co/smartpay-cashless-payment/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Cashless Payments](https://vantage.co/smartpay-cashless-payment/)\n\n  \n\nMake purchases faster with a flexible cashless payment system designed for attractions and leisure venues.\n\n[![Image 10](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Loyalty-and-Gamification-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/myperks-loyalty-and-gamification-program/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Loyalty & Gamification Program](https://vantage.co/myperks-loyalty-and-gamification-program/)\n\n  \n\nTransform casual visitors into loyal fans. MyPerks is a customizable rewards program that keeps guests coming back for more.\n\n[![Image 11](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/4-1-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/mycart-2/)\n\n  \n\n#### [E-Commerce](https://vantage.co/mycart-2/)\n\n  \n\nGive guests a convenient mobile ordering and e-commerce experience for purchases, upgrades and add-ons throughout their visit.\n\n[![Image 12](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2-1-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/smartvue-2/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Analytics & Dashboards](https://vantage.co/smartvue-2/)\n\n  \n\nTurn real-time guest and operational data into actionable venue analytics that help your team make better decisions.\n\n[![Image 13](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/VATNTAGE-SA-ZOO-15-1-600x400.jpg)](https://vantage.co/smartcontrol-access-control/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Access Control](https://vantage.co/smartcontrol-access-control/)\n\n  \n\nSimplify venue access control and guest entitlements while giving operations teams greater visibility across your venue.\n\n[![Image 14](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Push-Notifications-600x400.png)](https://vantage.co/smartnotify-personalized-push-notification/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Personalized Push Notifications](https://vantage.co/smartnotify-personalized-push-notification/)\n\n  \n\nDeliver personalized messages and offers directly to guests' phones, enhancing their experience and driving revenue.\n\n[![Image 15](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Vantage-at-San-Antonio-Zoo-SmartPay-1536x864-1.jpg)](https://vantage.co/smartpay-cashless-payment/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Cashless Payments](https://vantage.co/smartpay-cashless-payment/)\n\n  \n\nMake purchases faster with a flexible cashless payment system designed for attractions and leisure venues.\n\n### Hit Your Goals\n\n## One Platform Built Around Your Priorities\n\n#### Guest Experience\n\nUse connected guest data to create a more personalized guest experience, from relevant communication to loyalty points.\n\n[Explore Solutions](https://vantage.co/improve-your-guest-experience/)\n\n#### Revenue Solutions\n\nTurn more moments across the guest journey into opportunities to spend, upgrade and engage without adding friction.\n\n[Explore Solutions](https://vantage.co/revenue-solutions/)\n\n#### Smarter Operations\n\nGive your team real-time visibility and automate more of your venue operations, from access to guest communication.\n\n[Explore Solutions](https://vantage.co/operational-excellence-safety/)\n\n### Venue Types\n\n## Guest Experience Technology  \n for Attractions and Leisure Venues\n\n[![Image 16](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/april-walker-PAJ27rF0eww-unsplash-scaled.jpg)](https://vantage.co/location-based-entertainment-lbe/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Location Based Entertainment (LBE)](https://vantage.co/location-based-entertainment-lbe/)\n\n  \n\nUse flexible FEC software to simplify access, automate guest communication and create more opportunities to spend throughout the visit.\n\n[![Image 17](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/WEI-1000x650-Bucket-768x499-1.jpg)](https://vantage.co/hotels-resorts/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Hotels and Resorts](https://vantage.co/hotels-resorts/)\n\n  \n\nConnect hotel and resort guest technology across the stay, giving guests easier access to experiences while creating a clearer view of their journey.\n\n[![Image 18](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Image-4-600x400.jpg)](https://vantage.co/experiential-activations/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Activations and Special Events](https://vantage.co/experiential-activations/)\n\n  \n\nPower interactive and experiential events with technology that connects access, guest profiles and personalized interactions.\n\n[![Image 19](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Fusion-AquaSphere-Constrictor-Typhoon-Texas-Waterpark-33-scaled-e1734470248233.jpg)](https://vantage.co/water-parks-and-theme-parks/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Water Parks and Theme Parks](https://vantage.co/water-parks-and-theme-parks/)\n\n  \n\nAdd theme park and water park technology to personalize visits, increase guest spending and give operations teams greater real-time visibility.\n\n[![Image 20: turtle at the zoo](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/CR5_2597-Edit.jpg)](https://vantage.co/zoos-and-aquariums/)\n\n  \n\n#### [Zoos and Aquariums](https://vantage.co/zoos-and-aquariums/)\n\n  \n\nLeverage your zoo or aquarium guest experience technology to encourage exploration, strengthen membership and better understand visitor behavior.\n\n### Trusted by Leading Operators\n\n[![Image 21](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Updated-Logos-300x300.png)](https://vantage.co/mid-america-adventure/ \"Creating a Unified View of the Guest Across Six Flags St. Louis & Hurricane Harbor\")\n\n[![Image 22](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-300x300.png)](https://vantage.co/water-safari-resort/ \"Water Safari Resort Creates a Connected Vacation Experience Across Attractions, Lodging, and Camping\")\n\n[![Image 23](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/5-300x300.png)](https://vantage.co/worlds-of-fun/ \"Helping Guests Make the Most of Every Visit at Worlds of Fun\")\n\n[![Image 24](https://vantage.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Meryal-logo-e1781580603770-300x300.jpg)](https://vantage.co/meryal-waterpark/ \"Building Premium Guest Experiences at Meryal Waterpark\")\n\n[![Image 25](https://vantage.co/