out ServiceOcean Partners Team Careers / Jobs Media Events Contact EN DE Request demo SO CALLBACK Contact center software for e-commerce Online retail keeps growing, and so do customer expectations for support. ServiceOcean’s contact center software optimizes handled calls and cost in phone-based customer service, so you deliver an outstanding customer experience and greater operational efficiency, especially during Black Friday, Cyber Monday, and the holiday rush. See how OBI is driving digitalization in its service center and delivering a first-class customer experience. Request a demo Learn more These customers trust us Alternatives to hanging up Industry solution for e-commerce See how SO Callback improves handled calls and the customer experience for e-commerce companies. „Handled calls stay above 95% even during peak times. We would choose ServiceOcean again and again.“ Susanne Bornemann OBI Why is tailored contact center software critical for e-commerce? In e-commerce, outstanding customer service is a decisive success factor. Customers expect fast, precise answers and smooth problem resolution, whether they are asking about a delayed shipment, a return, or an order mix-up. Our software gives you the tools to exceed those expectations, even when call volume spikes by 200% or more during Black Friday, Cyber Monday, and the holiday rush. Together, we deliver value such as: Seamless handled calls: Guarantee that your customers get support whenever they need it, without long hold times, even during your highest-traffic shopping days. Cost advantage: Automated processes and smarter use of resources deliver a significant operating cost advantage, without the need to over-hire seasonal staff. Smart IVR systems: Use behavioral science and data analytics to design IVR scripts tailored to your customers' needs and to boost their satisfaction, whether they are calling about order status, returns, or shipping updates. With ServiceOcean's software, your e-commerce business offers customers real alternatives to waiting on hold for the first time. Management, customers, and employees are impressed alike! Request a demo How the software works „Agents talk to satisfied customers who did not wait involuntarily, but are delighted by an on-time scheduled callback.“ Susanne Bornemann, OBI Achieve up to, as an e-commerce company 38 % more handled calls 85 % cost advantage 96 % satisfaction 50 % fewer abandoned calls Deep dive SO Callback AI contact center software for 100% handled calls Get ServiceOcean's ebook and find out how to improve handled calls and availability with the same number of employees, using AI and behavioral science to optimize cost and handled calls in phone-based customer service. Download the ebook SERVICEOCEAN PORTAL Your KPIs at a glance Benefit from meaningful KPIs, automated data analysis, intelligent insights, and a new dashboard. Request a demo Learn more SOFTWARE FOR INBOUND CALLING Product features Dashboard & Reporting Speech recognition Customer notifications & call reminders Skill-based routing Real-time synchronization Text to Speech Satisfaction surveys (NPS) Simple bot connection FAQ Frequently asked questions How can e-commerce companies increase handled calls in customer service? Software solutions like ServiceOcean let online retailers manage high call volumes efficiently and offer customers targeted callback times during peak hours. OBI uses SO Callback and achieves 95% handled calls even during seasonal peaks like BFCM and the holiday season. What tools help with order and return inquiries by phone? Tools like SO Callback offer automated callback booking, prioritized call distribution, and smart capacity management, ensuring reliable service even during high demand. Handled calls improve significantly, even during peak periods. How can customer service be automated in e-commerce? Customers choose a callback time online. Employees are prepared in advance and can resolve requests faster and more precisely. BECOME A SERVICE HERO Contact Form Let's talk. \" * \" indicates required fields LinkedIn This field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged. Anrede * Title* Mr. Mrs. Diverse First Name * Last Name * E-Mail * Important: Please use your business email address. Phone Number Country * Country* USA Germany Switzerland Netherlands Other Company * Job title Comment * Your privacy is important to us. The information you share helps us keep in touch with you about ServiceOcean’s content, products, and services that might be relevant. You can choose to stop receiving these updates whenever you want. Our full policy is available here: privacy policy Send message Contact Germany ServiceOcean SalesDE GmbH Habsburgerring 2 50674 Cologne Germany +49 221 988 169 0 Contact Switzerland ServiceOcean AG Multergasse 11 9000 St. Gallen Switzerland +41 71 552 71 00 Contact USA ServiceOcean Inc. 1 Penn Plaza, Suite 4440 New York, NY 10119 United States +1 720-994-8036 ©2026 ServiceOcean AG Privacy Policy | Imprint"}], "aliases": [], "observation_count": 1, "_pipeline_context": {"run_id": "pl_20261125T033024Z_3a137824", "agency": "pearl_lemon", "started_at": "2026-11-25T03:30:24.978283Z", "pipeline_version": "1.0.0"}, "company_id": "18e517db-f1ed-5ff1-a895-2e160c801f12", "company_name": "Contact Center Software for E-Commerce | 100% Handled Calls", "canonical_domain": "www.serviceocean.com", "company_identity_resolved": true, "search_evidence": [], "crawl_result": {"company_id": "18e517db-f1ed-5ff1-a895-2e160c801f12", "canonical_domain": "www.serviceocean.com", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.serviceocean.com/", "path": "/", "fetch_status": "success", "status_code": null, "content_type": null, "cleaned_text": "Callcenter-Software für 100 % Erreichbarkeit - ServiceOcean AG X NEU | Alle Webinar-Aufzeichnungen kostenlos ansehen | Mehr dazu >> Demo Deutschland Schweiz Ich interessiere mich für: Banken Versicherungen Energie E-Commerce Andere Ich interessiere mich für: Banken